			"height": 1.0,
			"interaction_text": "Jalvoean Aspasia\n\nA familiar native orchid of Jalvoea's rainforests, the Aspasia grows upon the trunks and branches of trees. Its large, oval pseudobulbs store water, while its modest flowers reward a closer look with intricate patterns, successive flowering and a delicate, honey-like fragrance.",
