			"height": 1.0,
			"interaction_text": "Jalvoean Vanda\nUnlike many orchids that shelter beneath the forest canopy, these strap-leaved orchids thrive in bright light, often growing on exposed branches.\nDescended from orchids introduced from distant tropical lands, this hybrid was developed in Jalvoea and is particularly well suited to its warm rainforest edges and gardens. Its colorful blooms have made it a local favorite.",
