			"asset_path": "res://assets/overworld/sign_normal_outside.png",
			"height": 1.0,
			"interaction_text": "Crucifix Orchid\n\nThese showy native ground orchids grow from sea level to the lower reaches of the cloud forest. Hardy and adaptable, they readily colonize disturbed ground and are a familiar sight along roadsides and drainage ditches.",
