		{
			"asset_path": "res://assets/overworld/sign_normal_outside.png",
			"height": 1.0,
			"interaction_text": "Bamboo Orchid\n\nIntroduced through the tropical ornamental plant trade, these attractive orchids thrive in Jalvoea's lowlands, where their bamboo-like stems can grow several meters tall. Their vigorous growth has prompted discussions of population control, though local authorities have yet to deem such measures necessary.",
