		{
			"asset_path": "res://assets/overworld/sign_normal_outside.png",
			"height": 1.0,
			"interaction_text": "Fragrant Swan Orchid\n\nHighly prized among Jalvoea's native orchids, the Swan Orchid follows a distinct seasonal cycle. It grows vigorously during the wet season, producing large, waxy flowers with a sweet fragrance as its growth matures. During the dry season, it sheds its leaves and enters a period of dormancy.",
			"position": [
